                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Another taxpayer ripoff\u2014insurers collecting billions in premiums while not reimbursing the Veterans Administration a dime for the health services it provides policyholders. Approval of my bill to protect taxpayers and improve care, already endorsed by the VFW, American Legion, & Paralyzed Veterans, would stop this, saving at least $10B annually. Today, I urged House Veterans\u2019 Affairs Committee approval. As with other legislation I have filed, stopping  waste, fraud, and abuse takes more than Trump bluster; it requires willingness to challenge a powerful special interest. For those who have sacrificed so much to protect our country, we must prevent private insurer siphoning of taxpayer funds away from veterans\u2019 care.",
